**/.git
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/Dockerfile*
**/compose*.yaml
**/compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore
**/*.md
**/*.png
**/design-system
**/snapshot-*.yml

# Packed into the library nupkg by GUPBlazor.csproj
!GUPBlazor/README.md

# Served by the app; the blanket *.png rule above would drop it.
!GUPBlazorDemo/wwwroot/favicon.png
!GUPBlazorDemo/wwwroot/images/*.png

# The AI reference is regenerated inside the image, so the host's docs/ is not
# needed in the context — but the generator itself is.
docs
!tools/AiDocsGen/**
